{"name": "Wardens of Avalon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/e9fdd0eb557e3b4f98297f20a7d9fe22.poster.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/e9fdd0eb557e3b4f98297f20a7d9fe22.webm?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/e9fdd0eb557e3b4f98297f20a7d9fe22.mp4?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Knights of the Round Table</strong> have all <strong>fallen into corruption</strong>. Their once glorious estates lie in ruins, and <strong>Arthur</strong> himself might not be the legend the bards sang about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chosen by <strong>Morgan Pendragon</strong> herself as a new member of the <strong>Twilight Knights</strong>, you must <strong>rebuild Camelot</strong> into a fiefdom worthy of the ancient Knights of the Round Table. <strong>Slay enemies</strong> with steel and sacred light and <strong>explore Avalon</strong> to eradicate once and for all the dark forces plaguing the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/3fe6aacdb5cc0c802568fe79ffe3da00.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1200\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/263eca58ecab6ebc9573dc27f5726827.poster.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/263eca58ecab6ebc9573dc27f5726827.webm?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/263eca58ecab6ebc9573dc27f5726827.mp4?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the <strong>resources you collect</strong> throughout your adventures, <strong>rebuild</strong> from the <strong>ruins of Camelot</strong> a fiefdom that stands the trials of time and the <strong>unrelenting attacks</strong> of the corrupted forces of Avalon.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your new <strong>fiefdom grows</strong> and you <strong>open new districts</strong>, you will welcome <strong>new</strong> <strong>workshops</strong> and <strong>buildings</strong> \u2013 bringing in blacksmiths, druids, apothecaries, herborists and more to your land. <strong>Crafting</strong> and <strong>upgrading your gear</strong> is key in your journey through <i>Wardens of Avalon, </i>and taking care of your land and equipment will lead you to discover <strong>new quests </strong>and <strong>new adventures</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/bd0b6601d743340f52223cabd0561c50.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1200\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/6ff704f064ba1b669fb811655b6c91ef.poster.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/6ff704f064ba1b669fb811655b6c91ef.webm?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/6ff704f064ba1b669fb811655b6c91ef.mp4?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avalon is a land <strong>full of dangers</strong> and <strong>opportunities</strong>, where every region has its own <strong>challenges</strong>, <strong>quests</strong>, <strong>enemies</strong>, and <strong>unique resources</strong> to collect.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve your way through <strong>handcrafted environments</strong> and explore <strong>ruins</strong>, <strong>forests</strong> and <strong>former bastions</strong> of the Knights of the Round Table. There, you will face <strong>legendary bosses</strong> in your quest to end corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you rise victorious, you\u2019ll bring back <strong>key resources</strong> and <strong>items</strong> to <strong>improve your fiefdom and gear</strong>... before going back into adventure where even greater dangers await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/51e1a6860ac5a21967c0eafbeb15f310.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1200\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/b47a7d34b3d93a0c54da67c059ad3a52.poster.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/b47a7d34b3d93a0c54da67c059ad3a52.webm?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/b47a7d34b3d93a0c54da67c059ad3a52.mp4?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience <strong>exhilarating combat</strong> through a <strong>classless system</strong> designed to provide <strong>freedom to all players</strong>. Break your oath, swear a new one, and <strong>change your Twilight Knight\u2019s build</strong> according to what the situation requires. <strong>Gather</strong> and <strong>craft</strong> <strong>mighty</strong> <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>suits of armor</strong>, and imbue them with powerful seals to better suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your hammer to strike and stun enemies, wear sacred armors to boost your fire power or assimilate corruption at your own risk to deal significant damage. Prepare to dodge, parry and master the elements when the situation needs it the most\u2026 but you will not have to do it alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/f35d6a17e30f7b22b687fd72e81b2d1f.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1200\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/b60c0f3cdd95b87655c76f75aa664fef.poster.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/b60c0f3cdd95b87655c76f75aa664fef.webm?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/b60c0f3cdd95b87655c76f75aa664fef.mp4?t=1787132462\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Wardens of Avalon</i></strong><i> </i>is fully <strong>playable solo</strong> or <strong>co-op up to 4 players</strong>. Form your <strong>own order with friends</strong>, <strong>manage </strong>your fiefdom together, <strong>defend it against enemy assaults</strong> and prove your worth in challenging encounters where <strong>teamwork</strong> and <strong>coordination</strong> are essential to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team up with knights from all over the lands and set out on a mission to restore Camelot as the new Twilight Knights!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"528\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/extras/1a2ba501aff9b6c142e0fc0d9133dbbe.avif?t=1787132462\" width=\"1143\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Restore the former glory of a corrupt Camelot in Wardens of Avalon, an Action RPG set in a Dark Arthurian world. As a new member of the Twilight Knights, establish your fiefdom, explore, craft and gear up for thrilling adventures against the fallen Knights of the Round Table, alone or with friends.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409660/5b1a7f8eceba825f0344a5e1a016f5c00475cc20/header.jpg?t=1787132462", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Exploration", "RPG", "Hack and Slash", "Action RPG", "Online Co-Op", "3D"], "developers": "Runes Studio", "publishers": "Runes Studio", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2409660", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0B41bDSBqGY", "first_seen": 1780783200.0, "review_rank": 462}